    "description": "Receptive attention — orient, open, hold, acknowledge. Contrasts Thinking Knit.",
    "intent": "Demonstrate open reception vs inward cognition.",
    "authoring_notes": [
      "Eyes open rather than narrow.",
      "Macro softens wider rather than crown-up knit."
    ],
